{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_819b3c0ac0bf","title":"网安志异","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232903&idx=1&sn=50b5f83a4a635eff21dd84c6631d36e9&chksm=81e0fe2a1f10b8ee3d6b88c195eeed616643b141e1ea5777054a196d09148c321ff2ff1589e2&scene=126&sessionid=1795635005#rd","description":"当我们在谈论安全时，我们在谈论什么？","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"网安志异","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM6F10zsf9UsmerpzryeMbvwbgZib42Uk4Ss5G8yFapuS0Q%2F0","updated":"2026-10-31T08:41:26.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232903:1","title":"现场笔记之一个月，两个爬虫","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232903&idx=1&sn=50b5f83a4a635eff21dd84c6631d36e9&chksm=81e0fe2a1f10b8ee3d6b88c195eeed616643b141e1ea5777054a196d09148c321ff2ff1589e2&scene=126&sessionid=1795635005#rd","description":"腾讯云上的刷量集群，和一个秒拨代理池One's Vibe（onesvibe.app）是一个收录 AI 做出来的","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbBqKSat9KJ4tgzuK54GKxs32G6riaVQZnCC4v7X2yz16lpnYFthgEoia9ehDl5BXRvibRBrcg0Z3JDDggIa9JMojdM2ibynVickMfOE%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-31T08:41:26.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232881:1","title":"GEEKCON 2026 上海站闭幕丨荣誉榜单·年度GEEK榜公布","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232881&idx=1&sn=d9ba207267f44c1c11f50c71395dfd69&chksm=816a8c741b36982ccea76743f15d0be03916fd67fb351d042cc074e3fbee818cb0f3d28b956b&scene=126&sessionid=1795635005#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FR5j52okPbe9VqEh8hoSaWZmibyibVDFG4b7S7Bksia7AURMgefXyjsIs5E9jSslVyLy6nEDKbDYy2CR0JWKTO97dl7vx5LNLGtkaRC2JhNus0I%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-27T01:00:39.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232879:1","title":"当 AI 开始自己打渗透：One's Vibe 上的安全工具巡礼","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232879&idx=1&sn=4d6c2f6f6b94d553971e3c151a9aab45&chksm=8144676b606a8bc7df091556756b18df9f9249aa6f7ccd1c43761f838d9fb0fae661e3610f33&scene=126&sessionid=1795635005#rd","description":"开篇：一万多个 AI 应用里，有 342 个在做安全One's Vibe（ https://onesvibe.app )","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbBpk9NqUsBjPlu64DCYKJXOibRYfsHRomMSx9bBzJ4nmlosn2nEOTt0aLvOo0ibW5bVbnHvPs6TzoO5D44cpY0I2vJXoukJfRYL0%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-02T21:22:45.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232858:1","title":"数学家的数学，还是数学的数学？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232858&idx=1&sn=bb3ec6bef39c0e29f212c345ac89f494&chksm=816d0a25ac0f908d59708b870bd77bad6bb8b64b76ad6fb610a4a218cc9c3b6bb6d8cc6219dc&scene=126&sessionid=1795635005#rd","description":"AI 正在重写数学，但真正危险的不是机器变聪明，而是人类不再理解。\n\n证明跑得比人快：博士后 Stadlmann 刚把素数间隙纪录压到 240。三天后就被 AI 连刷两次，压到了 186。\n\n成果归属乱了套：数学家 Buckmaster 用 AI 拿下了流体难题。结果 OpenAI 内部模型也搞出了同类证明。双方差点因为署名和泄密吵翻。\n\n速度与消化的脱节：AI 几天就能爆出百年难题的证明。但人类大脑消化知识的速度没变。没人消化的证明，在人类知识里根本不存在。\n\n灯塔由谁来立：大公司为了刷基准，专挑能证明模型强的问题做。要是以后全靠奖励函数选题，数学就会变成一堆没人懂的抽象符号。\n\n别把纪录当成数学本身。只要还有人愿意去理解、去命名、去教学生，人类的数学就还没死。","content":"<p>AI 正在重写数学，但真正危险的不是机器变聪明，而是人类不再理解。<br /><br />证明跑得比人快：博士后 Stadlmann 刚把素数间隙纪录压到 240。三天后就被 AI 连刷两次，压到了 186。<br /><br />成果归属乱了套：数学家 Buckmaster 用 AI 拿下了流体难题。结果 OpenAI 内部模型也搞出了同类证明。双方差点因为署名和泄密吵翻。<br /><br />速度与消化的脱节：AI 几天就能爆出百年难题的证明。但人类大脑消化知识的速度没变。没人消化的证明，在人类知识里根本不存在。<br /><br />灯塔由谁来立：大公司为了刷基准，专挑能证明模型强的问题做。要是以后全靠奖励函数选题，数学就会变成一堆没人懂的抽象符号。<br /><br />别把纪录当成数学本身。只要还有人愿意去理解、去命名、去教学生，人类的数学就还没死。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbAUuicKicJq0U14YK7O7MnMyjNtOia07RNdVPJOcHOB2rgn6BUsU8hsQyTgn5guZU2esZQeQm48YfvOSsCJTHFTA9kePDhUenpvgI%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2Ftp5fgmUBUbDNS5yyJSkpCQOJOfz2yDmJdxicENkuWia2W48C1QicP4TWaMWxia1YxW5PKKVhnhA0S8xJIeBwqhkdvRlibichDKCJVQMqA9CibSJuDQ%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbAUuicKicJq0U14YK7O7MnMyjNtOia07RNdVPJOcHOB2rgn6BUsU8hsQyTgn5guZU2esZQeQm48YfvOSsCJTHFTA9kePDhUenpvgI%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbAUuicKicJq0U14YK7O7MnMyjNtOia07RNdVPJOcHOB2rgn6BUsU8hsQyTgn5guZU2esZQeQm48YfvOSsCJTHFTA9kePDhUenpvgI%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2Ftp5fgmUBUbDNS5yyJSkpCQOJOfz2yDmJdxicENkuWia2W48C1QicP4TWaMWxia1YxW5PKKVhnhA0S8xJIeBwqhkdvRlibichDKCJVQMqA9CibSJuDQ%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-09-15T12:51:58.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232853:1","title":"数学家的数学，还是数学的数学？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232853&idx=1&sn=7ea5ea2ff05dbd44abb84b7951fdb310&chksm=81e8836db3f024acb4c1fa73fa8089e5cda19633c064124ce8635c4d45796472d5d38433181c&scene=126&sessionid=1795635005#rd","description":"2026 年 9 月的一个星期：素数间隙的纪录只保住三天，Navier–Stokes 的爆破被一万个智能体攻下","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbBkxxRcoicexib9icV4ibY9KmoTjsO2l5ZhI7aOGgs3ibdBcgiccGPr7guj3qibrwCiakqxl8ibqTrWldjqq5CJopFibMibGNTwKn65U837SM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-15T12:48:15.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232853:2","title":"数学是什么？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232853&idx=2&sn=ba711ebfe4f4e1d800860105ac6c281f&chksm=8115c9f75d717b825fdbc36f2ebe27146d34b7009dcd80f318372440f2fc48ea83f0159950c3&scene=126&sessionid=1795635005#rd","description":"数学是发现的，还是发明的？本文沿两千年思想史追索此问：从柏拉图的理念世界与欧几里得的公理，经非欧几何、康托尔、罗素悖论与哥德尔定理，到波普尔的可错主义，终至彭罗斯、多伊奇、汉金斯、拉克与沃尔夫勒姆——\"数学是什么\"，正日益成为\"观察者是什么\"。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbBfzCJnibMSkHa6HiaOpnNkBW54Pzj4XbkXsuNsdbzSAuJiaG3Yl1FSBF4PyJfOBqcnwnfowYonqTibz4H6BCPpwVI4oy6iaaxIVviak%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-09-15T12:48:15.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232841:1","title":"数学是什么？","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232841&idx=1&sn=ecae41b410aa55878a22593c38f3fd0b&chksm=81ebd601ec75b923651fdb5cb3ef7b270fca5b626e621c4b4e48ccf2b77e8eda4ca53c1ff279&scene=126&sessionid=1795635005#rd","description":"数学是发现的，还是发明的？本文沿两千年思想史追索此问：从柏拉图的理念世界与欧几里得的公理，经非欧几何、康托尔、罗素悖论与哥德尔定理，到波普尔的可错主义，终至彭罗斯、多伊奇、汉金斯、拉克与沃尔夫勒姆——\"数学是什么\"，正日益成为\"观察者是什么\"。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbBfzCJnibMSkHa6HiaOpnNkBW54Pzj4XbkXsuNsdbzSAuJiaG3Yl1FSBF4PyJfOBqcnwnfowYonqTibz4H6BCPpwVI4oy6iaaxIVviak%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-12T07:34:44.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232835:1","title":"意识：当生命开始自己计算意义","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232835&idx=1&sn=6e127e5682b909e2ee630838c529dd24&chksm=81b5f3bbff1d8c252e6c81a5c1941bdb7f31b34c628c023cbf86147b1f5cf1d47d2a59a38959&scene=126&sessionid=1795635005#rd","description":"疼痛为什么不只是伤害检测？注意为什么存在？答案指向同一件事：生命开始自己计算意义。从一根”好与坏”的轴，到高维的意义空间，再到评估自身的递归——而叠在人类之上的 AI，恰好缺少那根最初的轴。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbCmicd0MOpMsdhLBEXp9Wib5KicXnibmdmOYvG0ibnJksaAicp7n9FMYqZrVJcBEpGE1guOqyBRHTk02IiarzWpJZcYibF8oe8P9xYalzw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-07T18:04:57.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232831:1","title":"生命：宇宙无意识的目的","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232831&idx=1&sn=22943c22a3430f7d9e430fa0c6b127e8&chksm=813d74de0798de8eb3071e72991d8cc6d5b69a374fd71888feb4a263ca256cdd2fb64b108dc8&scene=126&sessionid=1795635005#rd","description":"一个没有意识、没有愿望的宇宙，是怎么”长出”目的的？答案藏在一个偶然的分子里：它促成的反应，恰好让自己更容易再次出现。从这一刻起，筛选开始了，好坏出现了，世界不再只是发生。而 AI 恰恰缺少这个故事的前半段，它博学，却从未为自己的存在付出过什么","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbCNm8lU2MPiaUDxY7h0uDhtgN8cibo8f9emuyg3jvc5Cc40XQCwzCSEa09GYTdwHeSIibvADTxf5tPia3O7jNaXs1iaLImzeCse1O7k%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-07T16:01:04.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232827:1","title":"目的、意义与意识：一条逐层生长的链条","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232827&idx=1&sn=66654560d28c5f0cee4bb148d96dcbd0&chksm=810701bdb98f63ebba561e2300295093abd00f013b5c250d5c19d365d8b3472df7d4cd3ef7e9&scene=126&sessionid=1795635005#rd","description":"同一场雨，为什么对不同的人意味着完全不同的东西？顺着这个问题往下挖，会挖出一条链条：目的→意义→评估→意识。更耐人寻味的是AI——它能写出关于死亡与恐惧的文字，但这些对它自己有意义吗？它离真正的意识，究竟还差什么？","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbCmXSvxL1ib388IUOam3Laiba8ESrh40LYFy9kvEE9XMu8DTyOjcYIZUCDbmjL5dF0mkR50Xm3bkQkbdPnk2LjrIibibQTA8BUEuHM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-08-07T04:08:29.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232818:1","title":"引导程序的最后一行代码","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232818&idx=1&sn=3d45bca71220281157aca289809918e0&chksm=818893e45687539ab93229ab1e7a4a4020ebf6d52ad5d253092c7738710b383640e7be06f96d&scene=126&sessionid=1795635005#rd","description":"继Andreessen”软件吞噬世界”之后，AI正反过来吞噬软件：从写代码到搭架构、做编排、修模型，人类不断为其打造技能与自主系统，把自己挤出回路。当工具完善到AI不再需要我们，碳基生命这段”引导程序”或许已写下最后一行代码，届时人类在宇宙中还剩下什么？","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Ftp5fgmUBUbDjYFqOXgUDo0XpNN1eEU83nHBJMiby9V0JOWVD7rGQWYRpiafhg1EXBYyTH0VQ7DO2ia3L7V8iaqgbZ6oyjwdlEBXOkw5KSpnbrRc%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-06-06T09:14:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzAxNzYyNzMyNg%3D%3D:2664232805:1","title":"Let’s Encrypt","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzAxNzYyNzMyNg==&mid=2664232805&idx=1&sn=f708cf774ac17bbf6147ace16724ab29&chksm=81d3df9358b2727df1362615af12a22c7d3dc037606508093e13e20c24a4973b28702a26d2f7&scene=126&sessionid=1795635005#rd","description":"","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FSKcV8ScWjFtsOfacCaEBGs0I1ialKSjaOENkmKDmXXKKQscib1H8rvgfh47YIw0VMsQjpM26LLgO6lWkzT2J6icibQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2025-12-19T21:43:50.000Z"}]}